    ['Shihu-Danhu']                      = { type = "Teleport Service", icon = "WarpNPC.png", zones = { "Al Zahbi" }, zoneIds = { 48 }, note = "Notes:\nthumb|Oops... *He will warp you for free to an area near Jeuno. The actual destination is random: ** Ru'Lude Gardens (H-9) ** Batallia Downs (K-8) ** Rolanberry Fields (J-6) ** Sauromugue Champaign (F-5) ** Qufim Island (I-9) *However, if the Astral Candescence is lost, his list expands to include the above and several, less desirable destinations: ** Batallia Downs (D-7) ** Rolanberry Fields (J-13) ** Sauromugue Champaign (L-7) ** Qufim Island (F-8) *This NPC, just like the other NPCs of Al Zahbi, can be taken prisoner after a Besieged event; he must then be rescued. This can be accomplished by going to the appropriate prison area of the beastmen who captured him, then unlocking him from his prison. *Shihu-Danhu's older brother is Kaduru-Haiduru and he will warp you to Ru'Lude Gardens or your home nation for an Imperial Silver Piece. He is never taken as a prisoner, since he is located in the Whitegate area. Using Shihu-Danhu will make you \"reek of amateur sorcery,\" preventing you from using his older brother's pay-based service for one game day." },
