    ['Dabih Jajalioh']                   = { type = "Standard Merchant", icon = "Merchant.png", zones = { "Jeuno", "Ru'Lude Gardens" }, zoneIds = { 243 }, note = "Notes:\nAfter a certain amount has been purchased from her, she changes her greeting to be: Dabih Jajalioh: Hello therrre. I worrrk for the M&P Market. I'm still new, so I don't know much about selling stuff... Announces when her stock has changed in /say: My new shipment has finally come in. Talk to me, and I can show you what we have! * You do not need to personally buy items for her to upgrade her stock, it appears to be server-based instead. ** I bought a stack of every item available (the six standard ones) and zoned. Then she had additional items in stock. So maybe it isn't server-based after all ... See Also: *The Little Shopkeeper" },
