    ['Shantotto']                        = { type = "Quest Giver", icon = "QuestGiver.png", zones = { "Windurst", "Windurst Walls" }, zoneIds = { 239 }, note = "Starts Quests:\n* Curses, Foiled Again!\n* Curses, Foiled...Again!?\n* Curses, Foiled A-Golem!?\n* Blood and Glory\n\nInvolved in Quests:\n* Nothing Matters\n* Wonder Wands\n* SMN AF2: Class Reunion\n* BLM AF1: The Three Magi\n* BLM AF2: Recollections\n* BLM AF3: The Root of the Problem\n* Lure of the Wildcat (Windurst)\n\nStarts Missions:\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 20: Teahouse Tumult\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 23: Social Graces\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 25: Playing the Part\n* An Errand! The Professor's Price\n* The Voracious Resurgence: Koru-Moru's Hypothesis\n\nInvolved in Missions:\n* Windurst Mission 8-2 The Jester Who'd Be King\n* Promathia Mission 3-3: The Road Forks\n* Promathia Mission 5-3: Three Paths\n* Where Messengers Gather (Ulmia Path)\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 19: Sweets for the Soul\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 20: Teahouse Tumult\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 21: Finders Keepers\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 22: Shield of Diplomacy\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 24: Foiled Ambition\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 39: Allied Rumblings\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 47: The Empress Crowned\n* A Crystalline Prophecy (Mission)\n* Curses! A Horrifically Harrowing Hex\n* A Shantotto Ascension\n* Project: Shantottofication\n* Kupipi's Dilemma (The Voracious Resurgence 2-1)\n" },
